OL,3,GNEWSAThe deadly new drugs making
OL,4,AScotland's fight against addiction even
OL,5,Aharder
OL,6,
OL,7,FEfforts to bring down Scotland's
OL,8,Fsky-high rate of drug deaths are being
OL,9,Ffrustrated by the arrival of hundreds
OL,10,Fof powerful new synthetic substances
OL,11,Fthat experts warn are making the deadly
OL,12,Fdrugs crisis even more dangerous.
OL,14,FIn the past three years, there has been
OL,15,Fan explosion in the supply of new
OL,16,Fsynthetic cannabinoids and opioids,
OL,17,Ftransforming the illicit drugs trade
OL,18,Fand increasing the risk of fatal
OL,19,Foverdoses.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
