OL,3,GNEWSAThe deadly new drugs making
OL,4,AScotland's fight against addiction even
OL,5,Aharder
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnnual figures to be released on
OL,8,FWednesday are expected to show a rise
OL,9,Fin the number of drug-related deaths in
OL,10,FScotland, which already has an
OL,11,Funenviable record as the drugs death
OL,12,Fcapital of Europe.
OL,14,F"The illicit drug supply in Scotland is
OL,15,Fgetting more and more dangerous," said
OL,16,FDr Lorna Nisbet of Dundee University's
OL,17,FLeverhulme Research Centre for Forensic
OL,18,FScience.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
